<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea fin min confirms probe of unfair loan calls.</title>
<headline>S.Korea fin min confirms probe of unfair loan calls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's finance ministry reaffirmed on Tuesday a plan to probe unfair loan calls by merchant banks in the wake of rumours of financial trouble at the Kia Group.</p>
<p>&quot;If merchant banks unfairly call in loans from companies with sound financial conditions for no reason, the ministry will launch an investigation,&quot; a ministry official said.</p>
</text>
